      download -> Invoice_Extraction_Agent_Sagar (Run Job, SourceFile) -> validate (PONumber, numeric TotalAmount)
      -> AP_Invoice_Sagar lookup by InvoiceNumber -> insert (EXTRACTED) -> optional InvoiceQueue_Sagar item (Reference = RecordId).
    Invalid extraction: out_IsValid = False, out_ErrorMessage set, no record, no queue item.
    Duplicate InvoiceNumber: existing Id returned with out_WasDuplicate = True, no record, no queue item.
    System exceptions (bucket, agent job, Data Fabric, queue) propagate to the caller.
  -->
